{"id":"vod_sn_38654","vodId":"38654","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"我们大家的河合庄","name_cn":"我们大家的河合庄","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/66debbed94d4b6bc84ae4b09abd9e964.jpg"},"summary":"告别了多灾多难的初中时代，升入高中的宇佐和成（井口佑一 配音）下定决心度过平稳安和的三年，并与一名清纯温柔的少女共享难得的青春时代。在学校图书馆，宇佐偶然邂逅专心读书的前辈河合律（花泽香菜 配音），不禁心思荡漾。恰逢此时，宇佐的父母调动工作，为了能够自由生活，他计划入由河合住子（小林沙苗 配音）担任管理员的河合庄，结果却遭遇了小学时代的变态同学城崎（四宫豪 配音）、男人缘超级差的锦野麻弓（佐藤利奈 配音）和调皮腹黑女渡辺彩花（金元寿子 配音）。原打算从怪人世界逃脱，当得知小律也在此居住时，他却身不由己地留了下来。充满未知的青春时代，笑与泪共存的故事就此上演……　　本片根据宫原琉璃的漫画改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:03:27","playable":true,"episodeCount":12,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/GRUWyjmhW61/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/0HBDYsKGr01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Kq5T6s84ZK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/FBdLLqkMJw1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/ZqfAFdkGTq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/RFQFSRpaFf1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/i6sdC8FNGN1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5dc1FFuvuL1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/eBquHSAtMq1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/EuzUPnmHcR1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/tieejuFzeg1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/B8bdu4zYkM1/video/index.m3u8"}]}],"snapshotAt":"2026-10-22T15:44:56.325Z"}